                            	  1634: Burrower_AnimateDrawAndCheckCollisions:
02:00038B62 4EB900049066    	  1635:     jsr     Anim_AdvanceAnimCounterAndSetObjPosForSpriteDescriptor
                            	  1636:     ; If state = 0, return.
