                            	  2152: SecretArmosXs:
02:00038F38 E0              	  2153:     dc.b    $E0, $B0, $B0, $30, $40, $90, $A0
02:00038F39 B0
02:00038F3A B0
02:00038F3B 30
02:00038F3C 40
02:00038F3D 90
02:00038F3E A0
