                            	  9484: TestDir:
                            	  9485:     ; If (test direction OR target direction) < 7, then allow this turn.
                            	  9486:     ; Else go try the next test direction.
                            	  9487:     ;
                            	  9488:     ; For 3/5 of the arrangements of angles between Link and
                            	  9489:     ; objects; this test yields a turn towards Link. The rest of
                            	  9490:     ; the time, the object will keep going in its original direction
