02:0003E4DC 00040F86        	  3666:     dc.l    InitModeB_Sub1   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003E4E0 00040F52        	  3667:     dc.l    InitModeSubroom_AdvanceSubmode   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
