                            	  5212: _L_z07_UpdateArrowOrBoomerang_CompareLimit:
                            	  5213:     ; For boomerangs, compare it to the movement limit.
                            	  5214:     ; If it reached the limit, set state $20 and a new movement
                            	  5215:     ; limit of $10, and go handle the rest as if blocked.
